<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/features.css">
    <title>Features · Snippy</title>
</head>

<body>

    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    <div class="page-wrap">
        <div class="hero">
            <h1>Everything you need to share links better</h1>
            <p>Snippy turns long, messy URLs into clean short links you can track.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-grid">

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">
                    <img src="/images/faster.png" alt="Fast URL">
                </div>
                <h3>Instant Shortening</h3>
                <p>Paste any URL and get a clean, shareable short link in a fraction of a second.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">
                    <img src="/images/growths.png" alt="Analytics">
                </div>
                <h3>Click Analytics</h3>
                <p>Track every click on your links with timestamps, so you know exactly how your links perform.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">
                    <img src="/images/secure.png" alt="">
                </div>
                <h3>Secure Accounts</h3>
                <p>Your links live safely under your own account, protected with secure authentication.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">
                    <img src="/images/chart.png" class="chart" alt="">
                </div>
                <h3>Personal Dashboard</h3>
                <p>See all the links you've created and their click counts in one clean dashboard.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">
                    <img src="/images/setting.png"  alt="">
                </div>
                <h3>Admin Controls</h3>
                <p>Admins get a full view of every link created across the platform for easy oversight.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">
                     <img src="/images/website.png" alt="">
                </div>
                <h3>Reliable Redirects</h3>
                <p>Every short link redirects instantly and reliably to its original destination.</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</body>

</html>
